    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "MANDATORY final CRM lookup for an interested prospect.\n\nUse this tool after a matching person and lead have been identified.\n\nSearch for an existing deal using the exact company name associated with the prospect.\n\nThis tool MUST be called before the AI Agent returns its final result whenever the prospect is interested and a lead was found.\n\nDo not create or modify deals.\n\nUse the exact company name provided by the AI Agent.\nUse this tool only to check whether a deal already exists.\nDo not create or modify deals.",
